OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fmainly dry evening and night with
OL,7,Fvariable amounts of cloud and clear
OL,8,Fperiods. Quite a mild night with a
OL,9,Fmoderate southwestely breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA mainly dry start, some
OL,12,Fsunny intervals in south. Cloud and
OL,13,Frain spreading to Argyll then to most
OL,14,Fareas later. Strong southwesterly
OL,15,Fwinds along the Argyll coast.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCloudy
OL,18,Fon Sunday with outbreaks of rain
OL,19,Fgradually clearing from the north. Dry
OL,20,Fwith sunny spells on Monday and
OL,21,FTuesday, turning warmer
